Package: jlbind
Title: Bind R Packages to Compiled Julia Code
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Bjarke Hautop", "Kristensen", , "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Write parts of an R package in 'Julia' and call them from R
    without a running 'Julia' session. The 'Julia' code is compiled with
    'JuliaC.jl' into a shared library that R calls directly through its C
    API, so calls have almost no overhead.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/BjarkeHautop/jlbind, https://bjarkehautop.github.io/jlbind/
BugReports: https://github.com/BjarkeHautop/jlbind/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    parallel,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    callr,
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Config/Needs/website: altdoc, BjarkeHautop/altdown, BjarkeHautop/reftip,
    ggplot2, scales
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Julia (>= 1.14)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
